Article 8 (Requests for Cooperation from Relevant Institutions, etc.) Where necessary to efficiently perform its duties, the Committee may take any of the following measures:
1. The following measures directed to administrative agencies, public institutions, corporations, organizations, experts, or other persons:
  (a) Requesting submission of materials or presentation of opinions;
  (b) Commissioning investigations, research, evaluations, or similar work;
2. Collecting opinions through public hearings, seminars, surveys, broadcast discussions, or similar means.
